    "note": [
      "[b]Volunteering[/b]\r\n\r\n[b]How do we measure this?[/b]\r\nPercentage of people volunteering.\r\n\r\n[b]Source[/b]\r\nExperience of volunteering by adults in Northern Ireland, Department for Communities\r\n[url=https://www.communities-ni.gov.uk/topics/voluntary-and-community-statistics]Voluntary and community statistics | Department for Communities[/url]\r\n\r\n[b]Impact of Covid-19[/b]\r\nNone, since baseline is 2023/24.\r\n\r\n[b]Further Information[/b]\r\n1. New questions on volunteering were introduced in 2023/24 to measure participation of adults in both formal and informal volunteering. The questions are now more similar to those used in the rest of the UK. As a result of the change in questions it is not possible to compare figures for 2023/24 with those published for previous years."
